 Mobile Legends Website (MLBB_project)

A cinematic, scroll-driven landing page themed on *Mobile Legends: Bang Bang*, built from scratch with HTML, CSS and vanilla JavaScript.

This is a learning project. The page is the practice material, and the real goal is being able to look at any website, break it into sections, decide what each section needs, and build it independently. That is why this README includes a full debugging log: every bug, its real cause, and how it was fixed.

