 Features so far

- Loading screen: a 0% to 100% counter with a growing progress bar. When it finishes, the whole loader slides upward off the screen.
- Hero section: a full-screen background video chosen at random from three videos on every visit, with a "Mobile Legends" title that rises in letter by letter with a blur.
- Second section: a looping video background with a glass-effect panel. The panel fades in and its "Hero" heading reveals letter by letter when the section scrolls into view.
- Two endless image strips: rows of character images that slide continuously with no gap, and appear one by one with staggered delays.
- Third section: a video background section (in progress).

 Tech stack

- HTML5
- CSS3: flexbox, positioning, transitions, @keyframes, backdrop-filter, cubic-bezier() easing
- Vanilla JavaScript: DOM selection, classList, setInterval, IntersectionObserver
- No frameworks or animation libraries

